ass=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Winn Parish runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same middle saw November to December at 40% of normal and October to November at 66%. In 2026 so far, January to February sat at 59% and February to March at 46%, then May to June hit 159%. On grid 14549 the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 41.0, and that is not RMA&rsquo;s final index.</p>"}
